# Runs against the staged demo bundle (scripts/fixtures/flashcards). The
# missing/corrupt-collection paths are covered by check-flashcards-companion.
wait 800
expect Flashcards
expect Nature Notes
clean
shot decks

tap-id deck-0
wait-for-id answer
expect What does a compass point toward?
clean
shot question

tap-id answer
wait-for-id good
expect Magnetic north.
clean
shot answer

tap-id good
wait-for-id answer
expect What is water turning into vapour called?
clean
shot second-card

tap-id answer
wait-for-id hard
expect Evaporation.
tap-id hard
wait-for-id answer
expect How many sides does a hexagon have?
tap-id answer
wait-for-id easy
expect Six.
tap-id easy
wait-for-id back-decks
expect Review complete
clean
shot done

tap-id back-decks
wait 800
expect All done for now
expect Every due card in this collection was recorded locally.
clean
shot decks-after-review
